  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 17 December 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nEnjoy the very best of Glendowie living, with sought-after schools, beautiful beaches, coastal walkways and local cafés all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nJust a 5 to 10-minute walk from both Glendowie Primary School and Glendowie College, this beautifully presented three-bedroom freehold home offers an exceptional combination of location, lifestyle and everyday comfort.\r\n\r\nLarge windows throughout the home invite an abundance of natural light, while contemporary blinds and freshly painted neutral interiors create a fresh, welcoming feel. With all-day sunshine and three new Mitsubishi heat pumps, the home is wonderfully warm in winter and comfortably cool in summer.\r\n\r\nThe living area opens onto a sunny, north-facing deck and beautiful established garden, complete with fruit trees, while an upstairs balcony provides an additional space to relax and unwind. Private and fully fenced, the garden is perfect for summer entertaining, leisurely afternoons in the sun or enjoying time outdoors with family and friends.\r\n\r\nAn enclosed carport and two additional off-street parking spaces provide everyday convenience, while a garden shed offers useful additional storage.\r\n\r\nWith wonderful neighbours, a welcoming community, local shops just moments away and easy access to parks, beaches and St Heliers village, it's easy to see why so many people choose to call Glendowie home.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n \r\n• Three beautifully presented bedrooms\r\n• Freehold title\r\n• All-day sunshine and abundant natural light\r\n• Contemporary blinds and freshly painted neutral interiors\r\n• Three new Mitsubishi heat pumps for year-round comfort\r\n• Excellent indoor-outdoor living\r\n• Sunny, north-facing entertaining deck and upstairs balcony\r\n• Beautiful established garden with fruit trees\r\n• Private, fully fenced grounds, ideal for children and pets\r\n• One bathroom plus two separate toilets\r\n• Approximately 109m² of floor area\r\n• Enclosed carport plus two additional off-street parking spaces\r\n• Garden shed for additional storage\r\n• Separate laundry for added convenience and generous storage with four built-in cupboards downstairs\r\n• Zoned for Glendowie Primary School and Glendowie College, both within a 5 to 10-minute walk\r\n• Convenient access to Baradene College and St Ignatius Catholic School\r\n• Local shops just moments away, with parks and St Heliers Beach within easy reach\r\n\r\nWhether you're seeking exceptional schooling for your children, purchasing your first home, downsizing or investing in a sought-after location, this is a wonderful opportunity to secure your place in Glendowie.",
